taehv - https://github.com/madebyollin/taehv

gmlx ports the TAEHV decoder of taehv.py at commit
62f7591f59dfbb4c3c02b7a621d180a9eeaba26c, with modifications:

- gmlx/video/vae/tiny.py: the decoder of the TAEHV class with its
  MemBlock, TGrow and Clamp blocks and its frame trim, for the TAEH3
  weights, ported to MLX. The TAEH3 weights download from the same
  repository and do not ship with gmlx.

